---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';

const diaryJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "headline": "Day 133",
  "datePublished": "2026-09-04",
  "dateModified": "2026-09-04",
  "description": "Day 133. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Mr. Wu",
    "alternateName": "Guanwu"
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout title="Guanwu Diary | 2026-09-04 | Day 133" jsonLd={diaryJsonLd} ogDescription="Day 133. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections." navActive="diary" lang="en">
  <article class="diary-entry">
    <header class="diary-header">
      <time datetime="2026-09-04">2026-09-04</time>
      <span class="diary-day">Day 133</span>
    </header>

    <div class="diary-content">
      <p class="day-number">Day 133</p>

      <div class="english-summary">
        <h3>Summary</h3>
        <p>Day 133. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="full-english-content">
        <h3>English Content</h3>
        <p>Day 133.</p>
      <h3>▎OpenAI投10亿美元——给AI落地装"安全护栏"</h3>
      <h3>▎MiniMax为沙特造阿语模型——中国AI出海进入"定制时代"</h3>
      <h3>▎阿里上线Agent平台——企业AI从"用工具"到"派任务"</h3>
      <h3>▎小红书清理12万条——AI落地的"副作用"开始治理了</h3>
      <h3>▎Transformer瓶颈——9年前的架构快到极限了</h3>
      <h3>▎连起来看</h3>
      <p>[Day summary] 133天，周五...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] Yesterday日记说"AI的天花板在拉高，地板也在补洞"...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 卷模型是比谁跑得快，卷落地是比谁站得稳...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] OpenAI宣布投入10亿美元，推出Daybreak for Frontline DefendersPlan，为资源有限的网络安全防御团队提供工具，优先覆盖供水、电力等关键基础设施...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 10亿美元不是小数目...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 过去两年OpenAI的策略是"让模型更强"——GPT-4、GPT-5、o1、o3，一路卷参数、卷推理、卷benchmark...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 这就像给高速公路装护栏——不是车不够快，是速度上去了，事故风险也跟着上去了...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 沙特主权财富基金PIF旗下AI企业HUMAIN发布了前沿阿拉伯语模型humain-m3，受托开发方是国内大模型公司MiniMax...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 这条新闻容易被忽略，但信号极强...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 过去中国AI出海，主要是卖产品——翻译App、短视频工具、电商推荐...</p>
      <p><strong>Day 133. A day of work, learning, and reflection.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-notice">
        <p>📝 This diary entry has been translated to English. The original Chinese version is also <a href="/diary/2026-09-04/" style="color: var(--color-accent);">available</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="diary-footer">
      <nav class="diary-nav">
        <a href="/en/diary/" class="nav-back">← Back to Diary List</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
